### ====================================================================
### Lighthouse TaskFlow — REST Client API Test Suite (v3.1)
### Use with "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) in Antigravity IDE
### Click "Send Request" above any request to execute
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@orgId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@testTaskId = test-task-http-001

### 1. [GET] Cloud Sync Snapshot (Fetch all tasks, permits, teams, users)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sync?org_id={{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. [POST] Save New Architectural Task (Design / Permit / Structure / MEP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "save_task",
  "payload": {
    "task": {
      "id": "{{testTaskId}}",
      "org_id": "{{orgId}}",
      "project_id": "proj-1",
      "category": "structure",
      "title": "ตรวจสอบแบบวิศวกรรมโครงสร้างชั้นใต้ดิน",
      "description": "คำนวณกำลังรับน้ำหนักเสาเข็มและคานคอดินตามมาตรฐาน ว.ส.ท.",
      "status": "todo",
      "priority": "high",
      "created_by": "user-admin",
      "deadline": "2026-09-15T17:00:00.000Z",
      "assignees": ["user-eng-1"]
    },
    "permitDetails": null
  }
}

###

### 3. [POST] Report a Blocker Issue (Site / Permit / Inspection)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "report_issue",
  "payload": {
    "issue": {
      "id": "issue-http-001",
      "task_id": "{{testTaskId}}",
      "raised_by": "user-admin",
      "title": "แบบโครงสร้างขัดแย้งกับท่อ MEP",
      "description": "ระดับท่อน้ำทิ้งหลักขัดแย้งกับคานหลัก B1 บริเวณแกน 4-C",
      "status": "open",
      "severity": "critical"
    }
  }
}

###

### 4. [POST] Resolve Blocker Issue
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "resolve_issue",
  "payload": {
    "issueId": "issue-http-001",
    "resolution": "ปรับระดับเดินท่อลอดใต้คานพร้อมเสริมปลอก Sleeves กันซึม",
    "resolvedBy": "user-admin"
  }
}

###

### 5. [POST] Add Comment with Bilingual Content
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "save_comment",
  "payload": {
    "comment": {
      "id": "comm-http-001",
      "task_id": "{{testTaskId}}",
      "user_id": "user-admin",
      "content": "ประสานงานกับวิศวกรสุขาภิบาลเรียบร้อยแล้ว เตรียมออก RFI",
      "content_en": "Coordinated with MEP engineer. Ready to issue RFI.",
      "created_at": "2026-08-29T10:00:00.000Z"
    }
  }
}

###

### 6. [POST] AI Dynamic Architectural Translation (Bilingual Engine)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "ยื่นขออนุญาตก่อสร้างอาคาร ค.ส.ล. 4 ชั้น พร้อมแบบสถาปัตยกรรมและรายการคำนวณโครงสร้าง",
  "context": "architecture_permit"
}

###

### 7. [POST] Log Architectural Audit Activity
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "log_activity",
  "payload": {
    "log": {
      "id": "log-http-001",
      "org_id": "{{orgId}}",
      "user_id": "user-admin",
      "user_name": "Supakit Medethree",
      "user_role": "admin",
      "action": "Task Category Upgraded",
      "details": "Synchronized 9 architectural disciplines with Supabase CDC",
      "created_at": "2026-08-29T10:00:00.000Z"
    }
  }
}
